<title>USA: First Southern Bancshares Inc Q4 shr down.</title>
<headline>First Southern Bancshares Inc Q4 shr down.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Ala. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended December 31</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.10		    $0.27</p>
<p> Net			    192			510</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.28		     $N/A</p>
<p> Net			    538		    1,955</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Provision for loan losses Q4 1996 was $1.87 million versus $1.83 million at Q4 1995.</p>
<p>Total assets at December 31, 1996 were $184.5 million versus $180.9 million at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Total deposits at December 31, 1996, were $132.8 million versus $131.9 million at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>The company completed its initial public offering on April 13, 1995.</p>
